    "grammarFocus": "Limitation: не вполне (not entirely)",
    "hints": [
      "Which hedging expression means 'not entirely/not quite,' softening a statement by acknowledging partial truth?"
    ],
    "explanations": [
      "'Не вполне' (not entirely/not quite) is a hedging qualifier that partially negates without fully rejecting: 'not entirely correct, but with nuances.' 'Совсем' means 'completely/at all,' 'очень' means 'very,' and 'точно' means 'exactly'; none of these hedge."
